WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:47.049
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:47.319 --> 01:47.719
Li Xiao.

3
01:52.159 --> 01:52.560
Lao Zhuang.

4
01:53.799 --> 01:54.439
I got one here.

5
01:54.439 --> 01:55.040
Where are you guys?

6
01:55.280 --> 01:56.120
We're still at the square.

7
01:56.159 --> 01:56.840
Got one here too.

8
01:58.239 --> 01:59.680
Want us to head over to you?

9
01:59.760 --> 02:01.200
No need. I'll meet up with you.

10
02:03.879 --> 02:05.200
You okay? Are you hurt?

11
02:09.159 --> 02:09.560
It hurts.

12
02:12.960 --> 02:13.319
I'm fine.

13
02:22.080 --> 02:23.080
Don't even think about running.

14
02:23.599 --> 02:24.400
If you try to run,

15
02:25.240 --> 02:26.120
I'll shoot you dead.

16
02:26.879 --> 02:28.479
I'm not planning to run just yet.

17
02:29.400 --> 02:30.400
Though I think

18
02:31.120 --> 02:32.319
before we reach our destination,

19
02:32.319 --> 02:34.719
anything is possible.

20
02:40.360 --> 02:41.599
You'd better cooperate later

21
02:42.400 --> 02:43.560
and tell us who

22
02:43.560 --> 02:45.120
ordered you to go after Qian.

23
02:50.960 --> 02:52.120
The game isn't over yet.

24
02:53.400 --> 02:54.919
Why should I show my hand?

25
02:56.719 --> 02:58.520
From the moment you committed your crime,

26
02:59.159 --> 03:00.759
your game was already over.

27
03:23.000 --> 03:24.800
There's something I've always wondered.

28
03:25.719 --> 03:27.039
Tell me, among you cops,

29
03:27.439 --> 03:29.360
how many have actually fired a gun?

30
03:32.360 --> 03:34.159
Under what circumstances can a cop shoot?

31
03:38.039 --> 03:39.759
Would you shoot someone in the back?

32
03:41.759 --> 03:42.280
Take a guess.

33
03:47.680 --> 03:48.639
I'm not guessing.

34
03:49.319 --> 03:50.599
Shooting, to me,

35
03:51.159 --> 03:52.400
is second nature.

36
03:56.719 --> 03:57.680
Someone like me...

37
03:58.439 --> 04:00.680
is destined to live in the line of fire.

38
04:01.680 --> 04:03.800
Even if I die by someone else's gun one day,

39
04:04.159 --> 04:05.400
I won't regret it.

40
04:13.000 --> 04:13.479
Watch out for the car!

41
05:27.800 --> 05:29.439
Li Liping was abducted

42
05:29.439 --> 05:30.600
after getting off work this afternoon.

43
05:31.240 --> 05:33.360
The doctor said she has no serious external injuries.

44
05:33.639 --> 05:34.519
She admitted it herself

45
05:34.839 --> 05:36.759
that the kidnapper didn't really violate her.

46
05:37.120 --> 05:38.360
But having been traumatized,

47
05:38.639 --> 05:39.920
she's not in a good mental state.

48
05:40.720 --> 05:41.519
I questioned her briefly.

49
05:41.759 --> 05:44.079
Regarding Qian Feng's drug dealings,

50
05:44.199 --> 05:45.040
she seems completely unaware.

51
05:45.480 --> 05:47.600
She was still expecting to go home with him.

52
05:48.439 --> 05:49.000
By the way,

53
05:49.839 --> 05:51.879
when do you plan to interrogate the suspect?

54
05:53.680 --> 05:54.720
The suspect was just captured.

55
05:54.839 --> 05:56.360
His psychological defense is still weak,

56
05:56.600 --> 05:58.360
so we're going to interrogate him immediately.

57
05:58.639 --> 05:58.879
All right.

58
05:59.319 --> 06:00.480
I'll send people to assist you.

59
06:05.439 --> 06:07.120
Boss, the search team spotted the suspect.

60
06:08.639 --> 06:09.199
Officer!

61
06:09.399 --> 06:11.160
He jumped into my yard right over there,

62
06:11.680 --> 06:13.399
stole some clothes, and took off running.

63
06:13.720 --> 06:14.519
I couldn't catch him,

64
06:14.519 --> 06:15.279
so I called the police right away.

65
06:17.680 --> 06:19.160
Are you sure he ran in that direction?

66
06:20.399 --> 06:20.879
Positive.

67
06:21.000 --> 06:22.319
Yes, he ran toward that way.

68
06:22.319 --> 06:23.160
I saw it with my own eyes.

69
06:23.160 --> 06:23.639
Captain Cheng.

70
06:29.920 --> 06:31.199
Captain Cheng! Captain Cheng!

71
06:31.920 --> 06:32.360
Take a look.

72
06:38.959 --> 06:39.800
It's the suspect's

73
06:40.480 --> 06:41.000
scent article.

74
06:41.040 --> 06:41.360
Yes, sir.

75
06:48.079 --> 06:49.120
All right. Good work.

76
10:47.639 --> 10:48.759
I'm pretty useless, aren't I?

77
10:52.720 --> 10:53.840
Tian Xin left me,

78
10:57.240 --> 10:59.039
and the drug dealer slipped right through my fingers.

79
11:18.919 --> 11:19.879
You know why?

80
11:23.360 --> 11:25.480
If the dealers run, catch them.

81
11:25.879 --> 11:26.919
Tian Xin left,

82
11:27.639 --> 11:28.559
then win her back.

83
11:33.919 --> 11:34.600
Don't chicken out.

84
11:38.000 --> 11:38.919
Prove it to yourself.

85
12:17.200 --> 12:17.799
Sir.

86
12:19.559 --> 12:19.960
Sir!

87
12:57.399 --> 12:59.159
Currently, on Shuncheng Avenue

88
12:59.159 --> 13:00.720
and Shaodong Avenue, traffic is congested.

89
13:00.720 --> 13:02.320
Please take detours if possible.

90
13:03.039 --> 13:04.360
Next is a police bulletin.

91
13:04.960 --> 13:07.240
Between four and five this morning,

92
13:07.480 --> 13:10.039
a fugitive suspect entered Mount Ciyun.

93
13:10.840 --> 13:12.960
If you spot anyone suspicious, please call the police.

94
13:17.279 --> 13:18.159
Four-Legged Snake.

95
13:19.960 --> 13:20.639
What's that?

96
13:22.200 --> 13:24.000
I have no idea what you're talking about.

97
13:25.279 --> 13:26.159
You've been dealing drugs for so long,

98
13:27.440 --> 13:29.279
yet the biggest drug syndicates in Nanhai...

99
13:29.279 --> 13:30.320
you know nothing about them?

100
13:32.240 --> 13:32.799
Officer,

101
13:33.360 --> 13:35.559
I'm just a businessman trying to make money.

102
13:36.720 --> 13:38.039
Why would I care about any of that?

103
13:39.320 --> 13:42.279
Besides, I never thought about joining

104
13:42.639 --> 13:43.960
any criminal syndicate.

105
13:45.279 --> 13:46.039
Watch your attitude.

106
13:51.240 --> 13:52.320
The people who kidnapped your ex-wife

107
13:52.320 --> 13:54.159
were sent by Four-Legged Snake's crew.

108
13:54.159 --> 13:54.919
You didn't know?

109
14:00.200 --> 14:02.080
Even if you don't say it, we understand.

110
14:03.440 --> 14:05.000
The reason they kidnapped your family

111
14:05.519 --> 14:06.759
is that they're afraid you'd disclose

112
14:06.759 --> 14:07.960
too much information to the police.

113
14:07.960 --> 14:09.320
That's why they kidnapped your family—

114
14:09.320 --> 14:10.159
to threaten you.

115
14:10.679 --> 14:11.279
Right?

116
14:12.600 --> 14:13.080
Officer,

117
14:14.600 --> 14:17.480
how could I have all those drug cartels behind me?

118
14:21.360 --> 14:22.279
Look, officers,

119
14:23.039 --> 14:23.919
didn't you arrest me

120
14:24.559 --> 14:25.639
just to have me confess

121
14:25.639 --> 14:26.960
to my crimes?

122
14:27.159 --> 14:28.919
I never said I wouldn't talk.

123
14:30.519 --> 14:31.519
Whatever I did,

124
14:31.559 --> 14:32.159
I'll admit to it all.

125
14:32.919 --> 14:34.559
But why is it that up until now,

126
14:35.360 --> 14:36.960
you haven't asked me a single thing

127
14:37.519 --> 14:38.919
about my drug dealing?

128
14:39.440 --> 14:41.440
Fine. Great attitude. We're listening.

129
14:41.919 --> 14:42.320
Take notes.

130
14:44.799 --> 14:45.240
Go ahead.

131
14:45.960 --> 14:47.639
When did you start trafficking drugs?

132
14:47.840 --> 14:49.639
Who were your initial contacts?

133
14:50.480 --> 14:51.200
Who did you get the supply from?

134
14:51.720 --> 14:53.200
And who did you sell to once you got the drugs?

135
14:54.000 --> 14:56.200
Officers, if you ask it like that,

136
14:56.200 --> 14:57.559
then I know how to answer.

137
14:58.960 --> 15:00.240
It was in March of this year

138
15:00.240 --> 15:01.879
that I got into this business.

139
15:02.759 --> 15:04.639
I got my supply from

140
15:04.639 --> 15:06.879
Cheng Weimin at Jiangyang Xinghai Trading Company.

141
15:07.879 --> 15:09.840
Every time, I had him find a logistics company

142
15:10.759 --> 15:12.480
to hide the drugs in cosmetics,

143
15:13.120 --> 15:14.519
and then ship them

144
15:14.519 --> 15:16.519
to the beauty parlor run by my girlfriend, Gao Min.

145
15:17.360 --> 15:18.360
Once I received the goods,

146
15:19.360 --> 15:21.039
I took them to those drug dens

147
15:21.240 --> 15:22.200
and nightclubs to sell.

148
15:24.480 --> 15:25.039
I know

149
15:25.879 --> 15:28.080
you just want to bust those drug dens,

150
15:28.080 --> 15:28.600
right?

151
15:28.759 --> 15:30.639
Alright, give me a moment to think.

152
15:30.960 --> 15:31.519
I promise

153
15:32.200 --> 15:33.960
I'll rat out every single one of them.

154
15:34.279 --> 15:35.720
When you go raid those drug dens,

155
15:35.759 --> 15:37.960
you'll catch someone every single time.

156
15:38.000 --> 15:39.919
Officer, doing this...

157
15:40.840 --> 15:42.840
should count as redeem oneself through merit, right?

158
15:51.159 --> 15:53.639
Seven of your drug dens are listed here.

159
15:53.639 --> 15:55.000
We've already busted five of them.

160
15:55.720 --> 15:56.600
All the suspects involved

161
15:56.600 --> 15:58.440
have already been brought to justice.

162
15:59.759 --> 16:01.039
The remaining two drug dens,

163
16:01.840 --> 16:02.799
to you right now,

164
16:02.799 --> 16:03.960
are probably insignificant anyway.

165
16:08.960 --> 16:11.360
Qian Feng, have you ever actually thought about cooperating?

166
16:15.559 --> 16:16.159
Cooperating?

167
16:16.679 --> 16:17.519
Didn't I already say?

168
16:18.159 --> 16:19.399
No matter what you ask me,

169
16:20.279 --> 16:21.440
I will confess truthfully.

170
16:27.799 --> 16:29.559
Through Zhongtian Logistics,

171
16:30.679 --> 16:31.679
the drugs you transported...

172
16:31.759 --> 16:32.639
it was at least seven times.

173
16:33.279 --> 16:34.480
Every single time, you slipped past security.

174
16:35.240 --> 16:37.399
Was that pure luck?

175
16:50.399 --> 16:53.120
This is a full list of senior executives

176
16:53.120 --> 16:54.240
from Zhongtian Logistics' Nanhai branch.

177
16:55.120 --> 16:56.559
We want you to take a good look,

178
16:57.399 --> 17:00.399
and tell us who on here worked with you.

179
17:04.519 --> 17:05.599
That's impossible.

180
17:06.799 --> 17:07.200
There's no one.

181
17:07.960 --> 17:08.759
Absolutely no one.

182
17:09.200 --> 17:10.519
How could I possibly know

183
17:10.519 --> 17:12.240
these executives and big bosses?

184
17:18.319 --> 17:18.720
Fine.

185
17:19.640 --> 17:20.920
I'll just tell you the truth.

186
17:21.200 --> 17:22.279
Actually, lots of logistics companies,

187
17:22.279 --> 17:23.640
when they do inspections,

188
17:24.200 --> 17:25.960
are careless and full of loopholes.

189
17:26.559 --> 17:27.680
All I did was exploit

190
17:27.680 --> 17:28.759
loopholes in their management.

191
17:28.920 --> 17:29.680
Impossible.

192
17:30.319 --> 17:31.200
You moved shipments so many times,

193
17:31.200 --> 17:32.240
and in such massive amounts.

194
17:32.519 --> 17:34.559
If you weren't 100 percent sure,

195
17:34.559 --> 17:35.839
you never would've taken that risk.

196
17:37.160 --> 17:37.680
Qian Feng.

197
17:38.279 --> 17:40.640
You definitely had an insider working with you.

198
17:59.240 --> 18:01.759
We were going to take your ex-wife and daughter home,

199
18:02.559 --> 18:05.759
but they wanted to see you first.

200
18:18.480 --> 18:22.440
Are you trying to cut a deal with me?

201
18:22.759 --> 18:24.200
I want you to think about your daughter.

202
18:24.480 --> 18:25.640
I think she already knows

203
18:25.640 --> 18:27.119
she has a criminal for a father.

204
18:27.119 --> 18:28.440
When she grows up,

205
18:29.079 --> 18:30.799
do you want your ex-wife to tell her

206
18:31.160 --> 18:33.880
that her father remained unrepentant to the end,

207
18:34.640 --> 18:35.759
or that he turned over a new leaf?

208
18:47.799 --> 18:49.559
Now that things have come to this,

209
18:51.640 --> 18:52.839
I had no choice,

210
18:54.039 --> 18:54.920
and I accept my defeat.

211
18:59.279 --> 19:00.720
I've already told you clearly

212
19:00.720 --> 19:01.640
so many times.

213
19:01.960 --> 19:03.160
The one who supplied my drugs

214
19:03.160 --> 19:05.960
was Cheng Weimin from Jiangyang Xinghai Trading Company.

215
19:06.720 --> 19:07.920
And as for the distribution dens,

216
19:07.920 --> 19:09.160
I've told you many times already.

217
19:09.359 --> 19:10.359
I really don't know.

218
19:10.720 --> 19:12.720
What else do you want me to say?

219
19:13.319 --> 19:14.119
Where did the drug money go?

220
19:15.119 --> 19:16.759
If you didn't pay it to your supplier,

221
19:16.759 --> 19:17.920
where did your drug money go?

222
19:19.079 --> 19:21.759
Officer, I've told you this many times too.

223
19:21.880 --> 19:23.440
Cheng Weimin is my supplier.

224
19:23.440 --> 19:24.960
The profits from selling the drugs

225
19:25.160 --> 19:26.640
weren't pocketed by me alone.

226
19:26.640 --> 19:28.559
Cheng Weimin took the lion's share.

227
19:28.559 --> 19:30.240
How did you give the drug money to Cheng Weimin?

228
19:30.599 --> 19:31.720
Every time after selling the drugs,

229
19:31.720 --> 19:33.720
I used Li Xia's Alipay

230
19:33.720 --> 19:34.599
to withdraw cash,

231
19:34.599 --> 19:36.720
and paid Cheng Weimin directly in cash.

232
19:36.720 --> 19:37.799
Handed it to him in person, right?

233
19:38.039 --> 19:38.759
Of course.

234
19:39.119 --> 19:40.319
Except Cheng Weimin is in Jiangyang.

235
19:41.039 --> 19:42.200
You couldn't have gone all the way to Jiangyang

236
19:42.200 --> 19:43.640
in person every time you paid him.

237
19:48.079 --> 19:49.000
If there wasn't someone

238
19:49.720 --> 19:51.279
coordinating between the two of you,

239
19:51.839 --> 19:52.680
how could he trust you?

240
19:53.920 --> 19:55.680
Each of your shipments was worth at least a million.

241
19:55.839 --> 19:58.119
Why would he let you take goods on credit?

242
19:58.720 --> 20:00.759
You might not believe this,

243
20:00.960 --> 20:02.599
but I'm in this business.

244
20:03.480 --> 20:06.319
Without mutual trust between supplier and dealer,

245
20:06.319 --> 20:07.920
this business simply couldn't work.

246
20:08.200 --> 20:09.319
Besides, you can check

247
20:09.319 --> 20:10.680
my flight records.

248
20:10.839 --> 20:12.559
Over these eleven months this year,

249
20:12.559 --> 20:14.240
I flew to Jiangyang twice.

250
20:14.759 --> 20:15.920
Doing business with Cheng Weimin,

251
20:16.640 --> 20:18.279
he was in charge of shipping the goods,

252
20:18.279 --> 20:19.400
and I was in charge of selling them.

253
20:19.519 --> 20:20.759
We settled the books every six months.

254
20:21.200 --> 20:22.240
I handed him the cash directly.

255
20:22.240 --> 20:22.920
It's as simple as that.

256
20:23.519 --> 20:24.279
Trust?

257
20:26.160 --> 20:26.839
Simple indeed.

258
20:28.200 --> 20:29.799
So simple it's hard to believe.

259
20:34.480 --> 20:34.960
How about this?

260
20:38.759 --> 20:40.799
Have his ex-wife and daughter come see him.

261
20:45.039 --> 20:46.480
The guy on the run is named Huang Weiguang,

262
20:47.039 --> 20:47.799
35 years old.

263
20:48.759 --> 20:51.000
He has quite a rap sheet.

264
20:51.640 --> 20:54.039
For robbery and intentional assault,

265
20:54.200 --> 20:55.279
he was sentenced to seven years in prison,

266
20:55.720 --> 20:57.000
and was released just one year ago.

267
20:58.480 --> 21:00.119
These three men share something in common:

268
21:01.440 --> 21:03.559
they've all spent time in Chang'an.

269
21:04.240 --> 21:05.799
So we suspect these three

270
21:06.160 --> 21:07.400
have ties to

271
21:07.559 --> 21:08.559
the local organized crime syndicates.

272
21:12.319 --> 21:14.000
出现过 -> showed up. Correct. Li Qiang also showed up in Chang'an before.

273
21:14.640 --> 21:17.319
Could this crew

274
21:17.519 --> 21:18.839
possibly be linked to the drug cartel

275
21:18.839 --> 21:19.960
run by the man known as Boss Ma?

276
21:20.519 --> 21:22.559
When Qian Feng's drug dealing was at its peak,

277
21:22.920 --> 21:24.279
it was right when Li Qiang and his crew

278
21:24.279 --> 21:25.519
were lying low elsewhere.

279
21:26.720 --> 21:28.519
After Li Qiang and his crew returned to Nanhai,

280
21:28.880 --> 21:30.240
the only deal they set up

281
21:30.880 --> 21:31.880
was the one with Mu Qing.

282
21:31.880 --> 21:32.640
From the look of it,

283
21:33.200 --> 21:33.920
these three men

284
21:34.200 --> 21:36.119
probably don't work for this Ma guy.

285
21:37.440 --> 21:38.599
There's still something I don't get.

286
21:39.400 --> 21:40.839
The cartel brought these three in

287
21:41.000 --> 21:43.000
to kidnap Li Liping to blackmail Qian Feng.

288
21:43.839 --> 21:45.400
So why did they let her go halfway through?

289
21:45.640 --> 21:46.920
They wanted Qian Feng to know

290
21:47.559 --> 21:49.240
that they could threaten his family's safety

291
21:49.240 --> 21:50.160
anytime, anywhere.

292
21:51.519 --> 21:53.680
But if we had stopped the kidnapping,

293
21:54.359 --> 21:55.279
we'd have a stronger hand

294
21:55.920 --> 21:57.359
in interrogating Qian Feng.

295
21:59.480 --> 22:00.119
We kept thinking

296
22:00.119 --> 22:01.839
the kidnappers' target was Qian Feng's daughter.

297
22:03.079 --> 22:04.599
Who knew it would be Li Liping?

298
22:08.160 --> 22:10.200
Even though Qian Feng is divorced from Li Liping,

299
22:11.279 --> 22:12.240
the daughter's fate

300
22:12.240 --> 22:14.319
will always be tied to her mother's.

301
22:14.759 --> 22:15.880
Qian Feng knows that in his heart,

302
22:16.559 --> 22:17.200
and so do the kidnappers.

303
22:18.720 --> 22:19.720
Yet we overlooked it.

304
22:25.440 --> 22:27.519
That's all the intel we have for now.

305
22:27.680 --> 22:29.000
How about we follow Captain Bai's lead,

306
22:29.079 --> 22:30.319
take Qian Feng back to Nanhai,

307
22:30.319 --> 22:31.200
and let her interrogate him?

308
22:31.200 --> 22:33.440
We'll also step up our manhunt for Huang Weiguang.

309
22:34.400 --> 22:35.839
What Qian Feng fears most right now

310
22:36.000 --> 22:38.160
is that Huang Weiguang might hurt his family again.

311
22:38.799 --> 22:42.240
So as long as Huang Weiguang is on the run,

312
22:42.799 --> 22:44.160
it'll be tough to get

313
22:44.160 --> 22:46.359
any more useful intel out of Qian Feng.

314
22:48.519 --> 22:49.680
As for the hunt for Huang Weiguang,

315
22:50.880 --> 22:51.559
count me in.

316
23:06.240 --> 23:07.680
Based on the leads we have so far,

317
23:08.359 --> 23:09.000
we suspect

318
23:09.319 --> 23:10.880
Zhongtian Logistics' transport routes

319
23:11.240 --> 23:13.440
have become secret channels for drug trafficking.

320
23:14.200 --> 23:15.240
The prime suspect

321
23:15.240 --> 23:17.519
is Zhou Fuhai, account manager at Zhongtian Logistics.

322
23:18.400 --> 23:19.880
In addition, partners of Zhongtian Logistics,

323
23:19.880 --> 23:22.160
like Chaoqing Online Store

324
23:22.319 --> 23:23.200
and Yike Gifts,

325
23:23.599 --> 23:25.240
are very likely, just like Qian Feng,

326
23:25.599 --> 23:28.559
trafficking drugs through logistics channels.

327
23:31.200 --> 23:31.839
How's the progress?

328
23:33.279 --> 23:35.240
Qian Feng has already been brought in,

329
23:35.400 --> 23:36.720
but because his family

330
23:36.839 --> 23:38.000
was previously threatened,

331
23:38.200 --> 23:41.119
he refuses to give up his handler's details.

332
23:43.680 --> 23:45.960
I've already instructed Zhuang Yan and Ge Dan

333
23:46.200 --> 23:47.440
to bring Qian Feng back.

334
23:47.640 --> 23:49.799
Meanwhile, Li Xiao insisted on staying in Yangchuan

335
23:49.799 --> 23:52.039
to help local police capture Huang Weiguang.

336
23:53.720 --> 23:55.680
Tell Li Xiao to hurry up.

337
23:56.319 --> 23:57.640
Only after Huang Weiguang is caught

338
23:58.160 --> 23:59.359
will Qian Feng have the courage

339
23:59.559 --> 24:01.119
to expose the drug ring behind him.

340
24:03.920 --> 24:05.680
Could the suspect have already driven

341
24:05.680 --> 24:07.359
the hijacked vehicle out of Yangchuan?

342
24:11.359 --> 24:13.359
Every checkpoint in the city is locked down tight.

343
24:14.799 --> 24:16.039
He won't risk it.

344
24:16.519 --> 24:17.319
My guess is

345
24:18.079 --> 24:19.039
he'll lay low for a few more days

346
24:19.920 --> 24:21.440
and leave when the timing is right.

347
24:26.319 --> 24:29.000
Report: By the bridge on Chida River Street,

348
24:29.000 --> 24:30.559
the suspect's hijacked vehicle has been found.

349
24:31.440 --> 24:32.079
Copy that, copy that.

350
24:32.240 --> 24:33.720
We're close by. Heading over right now.

351
24:50.000 --> 24:51.240
Two phones. What else?

352
24:51.519 --> 24:53.200
My bag. My bag's still in the car.

353
24:55.799 --> 24:56.839
Is anything missing?

354
24:58.920 --> 24:59.799
Everything's still here.

355
25:08.519 --> 25:08.960
Captain Cheng.

356
25:09.240 --> 25:10.440
Did you verify with the owner?

357
25:10.880 --> 25:11.519
Confirmed.

358
25:11.880 --> 25:12.359
This morning,

359
25:12.400 --> 25:13.960
the two of them were at the foot of Mount Ciyun

360
25:14.000 --> 25:15.119
and got carjacked by Huang Weiguang.

361
25:16.160 --> 25:18.400
Traffic spotted the car 30 minutes ago.

362
25:18.759 --> 25:19.559
Did you check the surveillance?

363
25:19.799 --> 25:21.119
There are no cameras within several kilometers.

364
25:22.480 --> 25:23.240
When was it reported?

365
25:24.240 --> 25:25.200
Just past 11:00 AM.

366
25:27.359 --> 25:28.480
When your car was hijacked,

367
25:28.480 --> 25:29.319
what time was it, roughly?

368
25:30.160 --> 25:30.960
Past eight.

369
25:31.119 --> 25:32.160
Close to nine.

370
25:32.920 --> 25:34.559
Both of our phones were taken.

371
25:34.920 --> 25:36.359
We had to walk down the mountain.

372
25:48.920 --> 25:50.240
He could now be hiding

373
25:50.240 --> 25:51.960
in any corner of this city.

374
26:01.400 --> 26:02.319
Huang Weiguang knows

375
26:02.759 --> 26:05.000
he can't drive the hijacked vehicle

376
26:05.200 --> 26:06.000
out of Yangchuan,

377
26:07.240 --> 26:09.079
which is why he spared those two witnesses.

378
26:09.759 --> 26:11.000
What we're facing this time

379
26:12.000 --> 26:13.359
isn't just a hitman,

380
26:14.359 --> 26:15.720
but a seasoned criminal.

381
26:16.440 --> 26:18.279
When we first crossed paths in Nanhai,

382
26:19.279 --> 26:21.240
he not only got Qian Feng out,

383
26:21.519 --> 26:23.279
but kept his own identity concealed.

384
26:24.440 --> 26:25.279
And while our attention

385
26:25.279 --> 26:26.519
was focused on Qian Shu,

386
26:26.559 --> 26:27.720
he still managed, cool and unhurried,

387
26:27.720 --> 26:28.880
to kidnap Li Liping.

388
26:29.200 --> 26:30.039
This man

389
26:31.119 --> 26:31.920
is remarkably composed.

390
26:32.839 --> 26:33.920
Everything he does

391
26:35.759 --> 26:36.839
has a clear objective.

392
26:38.400 --> 26:40.920
Those two witnesses survived today

393
26:41.640 --> 26:43.160
not because he showed mercy,

394
26:43.160 --> 26:44.079
but because he knew

395
26:44.319 --> 26:45.240
killing them

396
26:45.920 --> 26:48.119
would only expose him that much sooner.

397
26:54.119 --> 26:55.359
But now that he's blended into

398
26:55.359 --> 26:56.720
the vast crowd,

399
26:58.319 --> 26:59.920
how are we supposed to find him?

400
27:01.160 --> 27:01.720
We wait.

401
27:03.039 --> 27:04.200
He will definitely slip up.

402
27:10.079 --> 27:11.119
The report is almost ready.

403
27:11.839 --> 27:12.839
I can send it over tomorrow.

404
27:15.440 --> 27:16.000
Okay.

405
27:16.400 --> 27:16.759
Alright.

406
27:17.200 --> 27:17.559
Goodbye.

407
27:41.839 --> 27:43.640
He definitely has no idea I'm back.

408
27:43.680 --> 27:45.759
I just wanted to surprise him.

409
27:47.839 --> 27:50.359
I'll sneak up behind him in a bit,

410
27:50.359 --> 27:51.680
and give him a good scare.

411
31:51.200 --> 31:52.640
All the recent evidence of their crimes

412
31:52.839 --> 31:53.640
is in here.

413
31:55.160 --> 31:56.920
Have they set the time and place for the deal?

414
31:57.400 --> 31:58.200
Not yet.

415
31:58.759 --> 32:00.720
But he takes this deal very seriously,

416
32:01.200 --> 32:02.880
so he'll make a move soon.

417
32:04.200 --> 32:04.839
Keep a close eye on them.

418
32:05.039 --> 32:06.240
Moving this much product all at once...

419
32:06.440 --> 32:07.640
they're probably planning to run.

420
32:08.440 --> 32:10.359
This might be our last chance to arrest him.

421
32:11.440 --> 32:12.319
If we're lucky enough,

422
32:13.000 --> 32:14.200
we might catch both of them.

423
32:18.279 --> 32:18.920
Stay safe.

424
32:20.599 --> 32:21.400
Be careful out there.

425
35:18.280 --> 35:19.800
It's already been 36 hours.

426
35:20.280 --> 35:21.519
I wonder if Huang Weiguang has fled.

427
35:22.559 --> 35:23.559
I don't think he ran.

428
35:24.760 --> 35:25.559
He's right here,

429
35:26.079 --> 35:27.960
patiently waiting for us to let our guard down.

430
36:31.760 --> 36:32.280
Go ahead.

431
36:32.800 --> 36:33.400
Boss,

432
36:33.599 --> 36:35.320
we got a report at three this afternoon.

433
36:35.519 --> 36:37.440
Outside Unit Three, Building Five of Fuli Community,

434
36:37.480 --> 36:39.039
someone found a note

435
36:39.039 --> 36:41.079
with an SOS and an address on it.

436
36:41.400 --> 36:42.840
After receiving the emergency call,

437
36:42.840 --> 36:43.960
officers rushed to the scene immediately.

438
36:44.440 --> 36:45.800
Surveillance footage from the scene

439
36:46.440 --> 36:48.159
confirmed the suspect is Huang Weiguang.

440
36:48.880 --> 36:50.719
Officers are currently monitoring the site,

441
36:51.320 --> 36:52.800
but since there's a hostage involved,

442
36:52.800 --> 36:54.440
we haven't made a move yet.

443
36:56.320 --> 36:58.039
Suspect Huang Weiguang's location confirmed.

444
36:58.239 --> 36:58.840
He's at Xinhua Lanting.

445
36:59.079 --> 37:01.320
How fast can we get to Xinhua Lanting from here?

446
37:01.400 --> 37:02.760
Not far. Ten minutes at most.

447
37:03.000 --> 37:03.480
Head there now.

448
37:03.559 --> 37:03.800
Copy that.

449
38:45.679 --> 38:47.280
Help! Help!

450
38:48.039 --> 38:48.960
Somebody help!

451
38:49.320 --> 38:49.920
Help!

452
38:52.519 --> 38:53.079
Drop the knife!

453
38:54.679 --> 38:55.199
Stay back!

454
38:56.559 --> 38:57.400
Come any closer and I'll kill her!

455
38:57.480 --> 38:58.000
Huang Weiguang.

456
38:58.599 --> 38:59.679
You have no way out.

457
39:05.800 --> 39:07.119
I never had a chance anyway!

458
39:08.920 --> 39:09.679
Cut the crap!

459
39:09.840 --> 39:10.400
Huang Weiguang,

460
39:11.239 --> 39:12.599
with all these guns pointed at you,

461
39:12.760 --> 39:14.119
do you really think you can get away?

462
39:15.880 --> 39:17.320
If I can't, I'll take someone down with me!

463
39:17.719 --> 39:18.760
If you don't want to see

464
39:18.760 --> 39:19.920
another person die,

465
39:20.639 --> 39:21.119
drop your guns!

466
39:21.960 --> 39:22.559
Let me go!

467
39:24.519 --> 39:25.360
Drop your guns!

468
39:26.000 --> 39:26.559
All right.

469
39:27.800 --> 39:28.480
We'll let you go.

470
39:28.880 --> 39:29.679
Release the hostage.

471
39:37.800 --> 39:38.239
You.

472
39:40.800 --> 39:41.480
Throw it over.

473
39:52.360 --> 39:52.800
Step back!

474
40:34.719 --> 40:35.320
Call an ambulance!

475
40:35.320 --> 40:35.679
Yes, sir!

476
41:04.559 --> 41:05.639
We were still one step too late.

477
41:08.599 --> 41:10.800
As cops, all we can do is try our best

478
41:10.800 --> 41:11.880
to protect the public.

479
41:12.440 --> 41:13.199
Some accidents

480
41:13.360 --> 41:14.840
simply can't be foreseen or controlled.

481
41:17.599 --> 41:18.719
Good thing your shot was right on target.

482
41:19.159 --> 41:20.239
Otherwise, the hostage would've been killed.

483
41:22.440 --> 41:23.800
If you hadn't hidden your gun so well,

484
41:26.119 --> 41:27.719
I wouldn't have had the chance to save the hostage.

485
41:31.679 --> 41:33.039
What made you think of hiding a gun?

486
41:35.039 --> 41:36.400
Have you ever seen a John Woo movie?

487
41:50.199 --> 41:51.159
Captain Bai, Captain Lu.

488
41:52.039 --> 41:52.599
You're back.

489
41:53.079 --> 41:53.719
Good work.

490
41:53.920 --> 41:54.559
Not at all.

491
41:54.920 --> 41:56.280
Except that blockhead Zhuang Yan...

492
41:56.280 --> 41:57.400
talked about the case the whole way.

493
41:58.719 --> 41:59.840
That must have been rough, then.

494
42:01.119 --> 42:02.079
I heard that Qian Feng...

495
42:02.119 --> 42:03.480
took the blame for everything alone.

496
42:04.440 --> 42:06.760
The syndicate threatened Qian Feng's family

497
42:07.440 --> 42:08.639
basically to Sacrifice a pawn to save the king.

498
42:09.639 --> 42:11.199
Besides, on the logistics company's client list,

499
42:11.559 --> 42:12.679
there are two other suspects.

500
42:13.559 --> 42:15.280
Qian Feng is worried about his family's safety,

501
42:15.519 --> 42:16.840
which is why he refuses to tell the truth.

502
42:17.559 --> 42:19.440
If we can track down Huang Weiguang soon,

503
42:19.920 --> 42:21.119
we might still turn the tables.

504
42:22.760 --> 42:23.639
Don't worry.

505
42:23.840 --> 42:24.920
Li Xiao is already looking into it.

506
42:25.039 --> 42:27.280
You two have had a long journey.

507
42:27.440 --> 42:28.039
You must be exhausted.

508
42:28.239 --> 42:28.960
Go get some rest.

509
42:29.880 --> 42:30.440
Thank you, Captain.

510
42:32.960 --> 42:33.960
Breaks are rare.

511
42:33.960 --> 42:35.840
Let's go grab a coffee, then.

512
42:41.719 --> 42:42.320
Thanks, Captain Bai.

513
42:50.199 --> 42:52.400
Zhuang Yan is finally catching on.

514
42:53.760 --> 42:54.519
You're overthinking it.
